#! seed 1861
# Civil War Strategy played from the start (QB64Rust's tools/screen/README.md, "Prompts").
# Two turns as the Union, from March to July 1861: recruit, two moves, a ship, a railroad move, the Union Armies,
# Cities and Battles reports, Fortify, the Utility menu, a save; END TURN twice, so that the computer moves and two
# battles are fought; then Files, Quit, Yes. A prompt before every key: the game announces each wait, a menu after
# every arrow key. A state at each new kind of screen.

# title menu: Start NEW Game
prompt
state
key enter
